WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.480
Sengoku

00:04.550 --> 00:06.860
Let's get to sleep.

00:07.330 --> 00:09.780
I kicked your table! Sorry!

00:09.780 --> 00:12.550
Hey, it's late. Keep your voice down!

00:12.550 --> 00:14.860
I'll put my stuff over here.

00:15.490 --> 00:18.920
Does Kakeru have friends close 
enough to invite for a sleepover?

00:18.920 --> 00:20.790
I'm sure he does.

00:21.550 --> 00:24.040
Sengoku-san, I want the loft bed!

00:24.040 --> 00:26.390
Sure. I'll tidy it up for you.

00:26.390 --> 00:27.980
No need! I'll take it as-is!

00:28.340 --> 00:30.020
It's really messy.

00:30.020 --> 00:31.430
Really, it's fine!

00:31.430 --> 00:34.610
I'm serious. There are more books 
than can be considered safe.

00:34.610 --> 00:36.550
It's like it was falling rock zone.

00:37.460 --> 00:39.150
I-I...

00:39.150 --> 00:40.920
I love falling rock zones!

00:40.920 --> 00:42.310
What are you talking about?!

00:42.310 --> 00:46.260
Well, if you're sure, I guess I don't mind.

00:48.080 --> 00:50.310
Okay, is that settled?

00:50.310 --> 00:52.150
I can take the floor.

00:52.150 --> 00:53.530
The floor?

00:53.530 --> 00:55.570
Well, I can take the floor...

00:55.570 --> 00:57.990
<b>Snore</b>

00:55.570 --> 00:58.090
except someone's already sleeping there.

00:58.090 --> 00:59.760
That was fast, Miyamura-kun!

00:59.760 --> 01:01.950
Miyamura, move over.

01:04.460 --> 01:07.090
S-Sorry it's so cramped.

01:07.090 --> 01:08.780
Nah, it's fine.

01:11.620 --> 01:12.940
It's so hot...

01:12.210 --> 01:16.220
<i>Ahhh</i>

01:12.940 --> 01:13.990
No, idiot! Don't take that off!

01:13.990 --> 01:17.010
You'll be throwing away all your hard work!

01:17.420 --> 01:18.180
What's the matter?

01:18.180 --> 01:19.160
It's nothing!

01:19.160 --> 01:20.430
Good night!

01:23.360 --> 01:24.540
Good night.

01:25.720 --> 01:27.370
<i>I'll get to sleep, too.</i>

01:28.650 --> 01:29.190
<b>Cramped</b>

01:29.190 --> 01:31.360
<b>Cramped</b>

01:31.360 --> 01:34.450
<i>There's no space for me to sleep.</i>

03:09.320 --> 03:11.500
<i>If Ishikawa-kun goes here...</i>

03:11.500 --> 03:14.460
<i>and Miyamura-kun goes here...</i>

03:13.250 --> 03:14.460
<b>Simulation</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:15.690
Ishikawa—

03:15.690 --> 03:16.690
<i>He's asleep!</i>

03:17.880 --> 03:23.470
<b>Sleepover</b>

03:17.960 --> 03:20.590
M-Miyamura-kun?

03:20.590 --> 03:22.340
Hey...

03:23.790 --> 03:25.400
No, Hori-san...

03:25.400 --> 03:27.310
Those are my organs.

03:27.510 --> 03:28.390
<i><b>Chill</b></i>

03:27.510 --> 03:29.980
<i>What kind of dream are you having?</i>

03:28.390 --> 03:29.980
<i><b>Chill</b></i>

03:29.980 --> 03:33.270
Motoko, wait, is that...?

03:33.270 --> 03:34.670
Oh, it's just a goldfish.

03:34.730 --> 03:37.480
<b>Thump</b>

03:34.730 --> 03:37.480
<i>A goldfish? And who is Motoko?</i>

03:37.780 --> 03:39.440
<b>Silence</b>

03:41.130 --> 03:42.440
<i>Now what?</i>

03:42.440 --> 03:46.140
<i>I wish I cleaned my room more regularly.</i>

03:46.500 --> 03:50.350
Keep your room clean, idiot.

03:50.350 --> 03:52.120
<i>Mom, I'm sorry.</i>

03:52.120 --> 03:54.330
No, wait! It's not messy!

03:54.770 --> 03:56.150
My room's just small!

03:56.150 --> 03:58.250
Just look at all these books!

03:58.550 --> 04:00.760
My dad has books in here, too!

03:58.550 --> 04:00.760
Animals of the World Insects Fish The Human Body

04:00.760 --> 04:02.390
Those all take up space.

04:02.390 --> 04:04.260
That's why there's no place to sleep.

04:05.160 --> 04:06.390
Oh, sorry.

04:07.620 --> 04:09.030
Oh, Iura-kun...

04:09.030 --> 04:09.860
Why are you up?

04:09.860 --> 04:11.810
I need to use the restroom.

04:12.120 --> 04:14.520
Sengoku-san, aren't you going to sleep?

04:17.210 --> 04:19.340
Why didn't you say something?

04:19.340 --> 04:22.030
We're the ones imposing.

04:22.030 --> 04:24.660
It just didn't seem right to wake anyone up.

04:24.660 --> 04:26.820
Wake up and fall in!

04:26.820 --> 04:29.650
You don't need to do that!

04:30.510 --> 04:32.160
What?

04:32.160 --> 04:34.890
Sengoku doesn't have space to sleep?

04:34.890 --> 04:36.770
You should've said so, idiot.

04:36.770 --> 04:38.170
Sorry.

04:38.170 --> 04:40.280
I'll move closer to the wall,

04:40.280 --> 04:44.170
that lump who isn't waking up 
gets moved to the bookcase...

04:44.500 --> 04:47.260
Sengoku, can you cut yourself in half?

04:47.260 --> 04:47.930
No.

04:47.930 --> 04:51.640
Maybe if you and Miyamura
slept in the loft...

04:51.640 --> 04:53.020
I don't mind.

04:53.020 --> 04:55.950
How? There's only enough room for one.

04:55.950 --> 04:57.190
You'll both fit.

04:57.190 --> 04:59.940
It's one half plus one half.

04:59.940 --> 05:01.190
<b>They add up to one.</b>

05:01.520 --> 05:04.350
Damn, I didn't want to, 
but there's no other choice.

05:04.350 --> 05:06.320
Miyamura-kun, let's go up to the loft.

05:06.760 --> 05:10.690
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! 
I'll go home, Kyosuke-san...

05:10.690 --> 05:11.700
Hey!

05:16.670 --> 05:21.610
<i>The two of us managed to squeeze in, 
but I don't like this.</i>

05:23.960 --> 05:26.450
<i>No, idiot! Don't take that off!</i>

05:26.450 --> 05:28.210
<i>The pool... Damn...</i>

05:28.210 --> 05:30.600
<i>Oh, I'll go change over there.</i>

05:31.340 --> 05:35.040
I accidentally sprayed Miyamura 
with a hose the other day.

05:35.040 --> 05:38.680
But he refused to take off his uniform.

05:41.150 --> 05:42.860
<i>I wonder why.</i>

05:44.140 --> 05:46.230
Sengoku-san, sorry!

05:46.480 --> 05:49.000
I left my cell phone...

05:51.440 --> 05:52.910
Sorry, I just remembered...

05:52.910 --> 05:57.650
I broke it in half, mangled it, turned it 
into dust, and washed it down the gutter.

05:57.650 --> 06:00.000
Wait, wait, wait, wait! Just hold on!

06:00.000 --> 06:02.660
No, don't mind me.

06:02.660 --> 06:06.220
No matter what you do, 
you'll still be Sengoku-san.

06:06.220 --> 06:08.260
That makes it sound worse!

06:08.260 --> 06:09.520
It's not what it looks like!

06:09.520 --> 06:11.480
Stop and listen to me!

06:11.480 --> 06:14.640
No, I've seen all I needed to see.

06:14.970 --> 06:17.270
You can't convince me otherwise.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.310
Don't be stubborn about it!

06:20.560 --> 06:23.220
I respect you, Sengoku-san.

06:23.550 --> 06:25.530
So I want to hear you out.

06:26.010 --> 06:29.210
It's just... There's...

06:29.210 --> 06:31.950
Don't trail off! You've got it wrong!

06:31.950 --> 06:34.010
I just tried to take his shirt off!

06:34.010 --> 06:35.980
I have a reason! I'm serious!

06:35.980 --> 06:37.290
It's nothing more than—

06:37.690 --> 06:39.380
You were trying to take his shirt off...

06:41.050 --> 06:42.840
I respect you.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.300
<b>He means it in a different way</b>

06:42.840 --> 06:45.300
Oh, no!

06:45.300 --> 06:47.170
No, Iura-kun!

06:47.170 --> 06:47.830
Listen to me!

06:47.830 --> 06:49.360
Iura-kun, say something!

06:49.360 --> 06:51.660
Don't go back down in silence!

06:49.640 --> 06:52.030
<i>Miyamura's under suspicion.</i>

06:52.030 --> 06:53.800
<i>Sengoku's pretty clever.</i>

06:55.640 --> 06:59.010
Hey, Sengoku, why don't you sleep down here?

06:59.010 --> 07:01.990
I'm up here because there's not enough room!

07:01.990 --> 07:03.060
Well...

07:03.360 --> 07:05.800
We just need to move the table.

07:05.800 --> 07:09.720
We'll take the books off and stand it up.

07:11.310 --> 07:14.120
How did I not think of that?

07:14.120 --> 07:16.540
What did we spend all that time doing?

07:16.540 --> 07:18.000
Yeah, seriously.

07:29.290 --> 07:30.340
What happened?!

07:30.340 --> 07:31.860
It's so early—

07:30.340 --> 07:33.090
<b>Sting</b>

07:33.720 --> 07:36.770
Shu was laughing in his sleep, 
and it freaked me out.

07:36.770 --> 07:40.000
I just laughed in my sleep 
and got hit for it.

07:40.000 --> 07:42.600
Definitely not the most 
pleasant ways to wake up.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.840
Anyway, good morning.

07:44.840 --> 07:46.280
Morning.

07:46.280 --> 07:47.760
Good morning.

07:47.760 --> 07:49.860
I don't think I got much sleep.

07:50.660 --> 07:51.860
Miyamura?

07:52.750 --> 07:54.030
Miyamura!

07:54.530 --> 07:56.020
He's still asleep.

07:56.500 --> 07:58.120
He just sleeps and sleeps.

07:58.120 --> 08:01.430
If he doesn't have school, 
he'll sleep until evening.

08:01.430 --> 08:02.870
That's too much sleep.

08:03.620 --> 08:06.130
I-I'll wake him up.

08:06.970 --> 08:08.490
Why are you looking at me like that?!

08:08.490 --> 08:10.880
I'm just waking him up! Nothing else!

08:10.880 --> 08:12.140
Me, too! Me, too!

08:12.140 --> 08:13.530
I'll wake him up, too!

08:13.530 --> 08:14.890
It doesn't take that many people, idiot!

08:14.890 --> 08:16.550
I'm going up first!

08:16.550 --> 08:17.490
Hey, Shu, wait!

08:17.490 --> 08:18.970
Don't! I'll go!

08:18.970 --> 08:21.270
Hey, it's my futon!

08:22.930 --> 08:24.360
Iura-kun, get off!

08:23.810 --> 08:26.020
<b>On
Miyamura</b>

08:24.360 --> 08:26.020
Aw, do I have to?

08:26.020 --> 08:28.600
Um, good morning.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.050
Good morning.

08:29.650 --> 08:33.280
<b>Shake</b>

08:30.050 --> 08:31.340
Morning.

08:33.730 --> 08:34.760
Is it morning?

08:34.760 --> 08:35.890
Yup.

08:35.890 --> 08:37.990
Why are you all up here?

08:37.990 --> 08:39.430
How can you ask that?

08:39.430 --> 08:41.490
Don't you realize the danger you're in?

08:41.490 --> 08:42.540
Danger?!

08:42.540 --> 08:45.940
Hey, Iura-kun, let's swap positions.

08:45.940 --> 08:48.700
We have to be careful 
or Miyamura will be crushed.

08:48.700 --> 08:51.110
Shu, stay right where you are.

08:51.480 --> 08:54.700
Sengoku might do something 
funny to Miyamura!

08:56.770 --> 08:58.370
No, I won't!

08:58.370 --> 09:00.370
Don't look at me like that! Turn around!

09:01.270 --> 09:05.330
I t-t-trust you, C-Class President.

09:05.330 --> 09:07.690
Liar! You're stuttering like crazy!

09:07.690 --> 09:10.070
But what are you doing 
so early in the morning?

09:10.070 --> 09:11.910
This is your wake-up call.

09:11.910 --> 09:13.570
This isn't a call.

09:14.060 --> 09:15.580
I need to use the restroom.

09:16.950 --> 09:18.940
Ishikawa, go down.

09:18.940 --> 09:20.540
Back it up.

09:20.540 --> 09:24.640
No, idiot! What if Sengoku 
finds an opening to Miyamura?

09:24.640 --> 09:27.400
I don't care! I really 
need to use the restroom!

09:27.400 --> 09:29.210
Fine, but I tried.

09:29.210 --> 09:30.730
I hope you can hold it.

09:30.730 --> 09:33.140
I'm eighteen, so I think I can.

09:35.380 --> 09:38.660
So, Sengoku-san, why are you after Miyamura?

09:38.660 --> 09:40.470
That's a rude way to put it!

09:40.470 --> 09:44.160
Listen, this is part of my job 
as a class representative!

09:44.160 --> 09:47.480
A class rep is supposed to 
undress another boy?

09:48.100 --> 09:53.300
Please, just tell me why 
Miyamura-kun hides his skin.

09:48.520 --> 09:54.740
<b>Whimper</b>

09:53.300 --> 09:54.740
Uh...

09:53.480 --> 09:54.150
<b>Uh...</b>

09:54.150 --> 09:54.740
<b>Uh...</b>

09:54.740 --> 09:56.410
I don't understand.

09:57.630 --> 09:59.490
About Miyamura...

09:59.490 --> 10:01.250
The truth is...

10:05.700 --> 10:08.370
It was a long trip to 
the class president's restroom.

10:10.130 --> 10:11.600
Huh? What?

10:11.600 --> 10:12.620
What's up?

10:12.620 --> 10:13.630
Miyamura.

10:14.850 --> 10:16.630
I covered for you.

10:16.970 --> 10:17.970
Huh?

10:18.430 --> 10:19.890
A bazooka in his solar plexus...

10:18.430 --> 10:20.890
Whisper

10:19.890 --> 10:21.580
A bazooka shoots out of his solar plexus...

10:21.580 --> 10:23.350
Just what did you cover?

10:23.350 --> 10:24.550
They're talking about a bazooka.

10:24.550 --> 10:26.010
You know, that thing you have.

10:24.680 --> 10:27.390
<b>More
misunderstandings</b>

10:29.900 --> 10:33.650
He wouldn't take off his 
uniform when Remi sprayed him.

10:34.060 --> 10:36.150
What? Is this about Miyamura?

10:36.540 --> 10:37.880
Who else?

10:37.880 --> 10:40.660
How would I know when 
you just blurt that out?

10:40.660 --> 10:43.680
I see. Miyamura...

10:44.160 --> 10:47.020
Ishikawa-kun, do you know something?

10:47.020 --> 10:48.700
Nope, not a thing!

10:50.310 --> 10:51.830
Man, it's cold.

10:51.830 --> 10:53.780
Let me warm up in here, Class President.

10:54.560 --> 10:55.420
Oh.

10:55.420 --> 10:57.580
Ishikawa-kun is here, too.

10:57.580 --> 10:58.510
Hey.

10:58.510 --> 11:00.760
It's a Miyamura flying into the flame.

11:00.760 --> 11:02.930
Huh? There's no fire here.

11:02.930 --> 11:04.000
So you've come!

11:04.000 --> 11:06.440
Why are you so happy to see me?

11:06.800 --> 11:07.960
Miyamura-kun...

11:08.500 --> 11:09.690
Are you feeling hot?

11:10.350 --> 11:12.190
No, I came in here because I'm cold.

11:12.190 --> 11:14.810
But you'll start feeling 
hot if you stay here.

11:14.810 --> 11:17.230
See how Ishikawa-kun took off his blazer?

11:17.230 --> 11:19.700
<i>H-He's being so obvious!</i>

11:19.700 --> 11:21.260
Really?

11:21.260 --> 11:23.700
I'm still feeling cold, so I'll keep it on.

11:24.630 --> 11:25.430
<i>Damn!</i>

11:25.870 --> 11:28.520
Miyamura, you don't wear 
a school sweater, right?

11:28.520 --> 11:29.960
No, I don't own one.

11:30.910 --> 11:32.200
You should try one.

11:30.910 --> 11:38.210
<b>Glare</b>

11:30.910 --> 11:38.210
<b>Glare</b>

11:32.200 --> 11:33.490
It'll look great on you.

11:33.490 --> 11:36.530
I know. I'll trade you mine.

11:36.530 --> 11:37.790
Class President, you're scaring me.

11:38.810 --> 11:39.540
Here.

11:40.210 --> 11:42.200
Wow, a school sweater!

11:43.680 --> 11:46.290
<i>He's going to change into it!</i>

11:46.290 --> 11:49.220
<i>At last I'll learn what 
Miyamura-kun's been hiding!</i>

11:49.220 --> 11:52.880
<i>Miyamura said his tattoos 
show through a white shirt.</i>

11:52.880 --> 11:55.740
<i>He'll definitely see 
through Sengoku's trick—</i>

11:55.740 --> 11:56.980
<i>You have got to be kidding me.</i>

11:56.980 --> 11:59.470
<i>Now, take off your sweater, Miyamura-kun!</i>

11:59.470 --> 12:01.240
<i>He's gonna find out, Miyamura!</i>

12:05.380 --> 12:06.740
Ow...

12:06.740 --> 12:08.100
Are you okay?

12:10.500 --> 12:12.900
<i>No!</i>

12:12.900 --> 12:14.500
This is so warm!

12:14.500 --> 12:17.160
Class President, this material is so nice!

12:17.160 --> 12:18.780
What do you think? How does it look?

12:17.750 --> 12:21.010
<b>Saved
the day</b>

12:18.780 --> 12:20.030
It looks great!

12:21.670 --> 12:24.630
I thought that would work.

12:25.030 --> 12:26.010
What would?

12:26.420 --> 12:28.480
Okay, I'll ask you straight-up.

12:28.480 --> 12:30.770
Why don't you like to take off your clothes?

12:31.520 --> 12:32.690
Because I'm a rational person.

12:31.520 --> 12:37.770
<b>Finally caught on</b>

12:32.690 --> 12:35.450
I'm not telling you to walk around naked!

12:35.450 --> 12:37.770
I mean when you change 
for phys ed and stuff.

12:38.340 --> 12:40.170
What? What do you mean, Class President?

12:40.170 --> 12:40.930
Are you obsessed with me?

12:40.930 --> 12:43.560
No! I just really want to know!

12:43.560 --> 12:44.450
Why, though?

12:44.450 --> 12:46.620
What do you mean, "Why"?

12:46.620 --> 12:49.090
Because it's clearly not normal.

12:49.090 --> 12:50.000
Why, though?

12:50.000 --> 12:51.540
Calm down, Miyamura-kun!

12:52.820 --> 12:54.590
The class president is bullying me!

12:54.590 --> 12:56.300
Give back my sweater!

12:56.300 --> 12:58.410
Miyamura-kun!

13:00.540 --> 13:02.810
When did you get a school sweater?

13:06.140 --> 13:08.300
Why were you running so fast?

13:09.160 --> 13:10.310
Kakeru.

13:10.310 --> 13:12.260
I don't remember that sweater.

13:13.050 --> 13:14.480
<i>He got away.</i>

13:22.380 --> 13:24.950
Wow, it's so cold!

13:27.070 --> 13:28.910
Remi, sorry you had to wait.

13:30.370 --> 13:32.450
Pat

13:31.200 --> 13:32.450
Pat

13:32.450 --> 13:33.580
Let's head home.

13:33.580 --> 13:34.470
Sure.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.290
It's cold.

13:41.290 --> 13:42.890
It snowed, too.

13:42.890 --> 13:44.460
We'll have to wait a while for spring.

13:45.020 --> 13:47.010
It sucks that you have to wear 
a skirt with your legs exposed.

13:47.010 --> 13:48.470
So cold...

13:52.340 --> 13:53.980
Hand. Hand.

13:56.350 --> 13:57.230
Here.

14:00.730 --> 14:01.880
It's cold.

14:00.770 --> 14:03.730
<b>Huh?</b>

14:02.760 --> 14:03.730
Remi-san—

14:03.730 --> 14:05.530
I'm warm now.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.510
But I'm cold.

14:07.510 --> 14:09.010
I'm warm, though.

14:09.010 --> 14:10.870
Warm!

14:10.870 --> 14:12.490
I see.

14:13.160 --> 14:14.070
Hand.

14:14.370 --> 14:15.500
Yeah, okay.

14:17.540 --> 14:19.540
Silence

14:32.360 --> 14:34.130
Hold my hand!

14:34.130 --> 14:35.520
<i>She's angry at me.</i>

14:41.650 --> 14:43.330
Make sure to walk properly.

14:46.860 --> 14:48.280
<i>It feels warm.</i>

14:49.990 --> 14:52.550
Sengoku-kun, are you warm?

14:52.550 --> 14:53.440
Yeah.

14:53.440 --> 14:59.830
Your hand is so thin and bony 
that mine isn't so warm.

14:59.830 --> 15:00.780
Oh.

15:01.290 --> 15:02.690
That must be awkward.

15:02.690 --> 15:06.900
No, I'm sorry my hand is so small.

15:06.900 --> 15:07.800
It's fine.

15:09.800 --> 15:11.800
Want to go somewhere?

15:13.690 --> 15:14.800
Nope.

15:19.570 --> 15:21.310
We're walking a little fast.

15:21.810 --> 15:23.910
I walk fast if I don't pay attention.

15:23.910 --> 15:25.250
Then pay attention.

15:25.250 --> 15:26.070
Right.

15:26.460 --> 15:29.360
Walk a little slower.

15:30.370 --> 15:31.320
We'll stop, though.

15:31.320 --> 15:33.110
Oh, you really stopped.

15:35.060 --> 15:36.360
Aren't you going home?

15:36.360 --> 15:39.250
Your place is right over there.

15:39.250 --> 15:40.580
You're cold, right?

15:44.680 --> 15:45.870
Hug...

15:53.440 --> 15:54.680
Never mind.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.370
Hug.

16:03.880 --> 16:04.880
Remi.

16:13.300 --> 16:16.230
Remi-san, let me move my arms a second.

16:20.950 --> 16:21.970
Thanks.

16:27.880 --> 16:29.130
Kiss.

16:29.130 --> 16:31.630
Hey, we're on the street.

16:30.670 --> 16:31.630
Push

16:33.310 --> 16:34.680
Understood.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.790
Good.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.890
<b>No kissing
on the street</b>

16:36.890 --> 16:39.390
<b>Library</b>

16:39.390 --> 16:42.140
<b>Mathematics II</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:42.140
Remi, are you ready to go?

16:42.140 --> 16:44.260
The library's about to close.

16:44.260 --> 16:46.170
Oh, you're right!

16:47.510 --> 16:50.360
I think I overworked my brain.

16:50.360 --> 16:51.990
You're working hard.

16:51.990 --> 16:54.650
Do you need any help with math today?

16:54.650 --> 16:58.090
Nope, I can do it myself.

16:58.090 --> 16:59.160
Yeah?

16:59.160 --> 16:59.860
Yep!

17:01.280 --> 17:02.750
Let's go, Sakura.

17:08.670 --> 17:10.170
Sengoku-kun.

17:10.710 --> 17:12.420
Can we walk home together?

17:15.290 --> 17:16.300
Sure.

17:16.300 --> 17:17.220
Are you ready?

17:17.220 --> 17:18.870
Yeah, sure.

17:21.270 --> 17:22.810
Is it that cold out?

17:22.810 --> 17:24.070
Are you with a cold girl or something?

17:24.070 --> 17:25.710
I didn't say that.

17:26.500 --> 17:28.580
Hori, is something up?

17:28.580 --> 17:30.590
Huh? Where's Remi-chan?

17:30.590 --> 17:31.520
I'm not sure.

17:31.520 --> 17:34.550
Those two don't usually 
go home by themselves.

17:34.550 --> 17:37.570
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

17:40.700 --> 17:42.400
No, it's totally normal.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.040
I don't spend every minute 
of the day with Miyamura, either.

17:45.040 --> 17:46.710
Yeah, you're right!

17:47.780 --> 17:49.810
Kyon-kyon, Yuki-chan!

17:49.810 --> 17:52.160
Have you seen Sengoku-kun or Sakura?

17:52.970 --> 17:56.070
I went to the restroom, 
but now I can't find them.

17:56.070 --> 17:58.010
Where could they be?

18:00.000 --> 18:01.260
Do you feel cold?

18:01.260 --> 18:02.670
No, not at all.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.220
<b>Suspicion Filter ON</b>

18:03.210 --> 18:04.910
Oh, I just saw—

18:05.480 --> 18:07.980
What was that for? It hurt!

18:07.980 --> 18:09.450
Don't say it!

18:09.450 --> 18:12.020
Why not? It's fine, right?

18:12.020 --> 18:13.580
Just don't!

18:13.970 --> 18:16.210
It's not like that, right?

18:16.620 --> 18:17.990
What?

18:18.300 --> 18:20.240
Are you hiding something?

18:20.240 --> 18:22.090
Huh? O-O-Of course not.

18:22.090 --> 18:23.320
Hori...

18:23.320 --> 18:26.000
Maybe they're in the student council room.

18:26.000 --> 18:28.000
I'll try calling.

18:29.060 --> 18:30.250
Huh? What?

18:31.020 --> 18:33.610
L-Look! On the window over there!

18:33.610 --> 18:36.070
There's an, um, giant bug!

18:36.070 --> 18:37.450
A bug? Where?

18:37.450 --> 18:39.280
Look, right there!

18:38.340 --> 18:42.140
<i>I don't think this is really 
Hori's problem, though.</i>

18:42.140 --> 18:43.390
<b>Return
trays here</b>

18:42.140 --> 18:43.860
Welcome!

18:43.860 --> 18:45.620
Have you decided on your order?

18:44.560 --> 18:45.620
Should we sit here?

18:45.620 --> 18:46.520
Sure.

18:53.300 --> 18:55.140
What's up, Ishikawa?

18:55.140 --> 18:56.940
I just saw Sengoku.

18:56.940 --> 18:58.250
He's with Kono-san.

18:58.250 --> 18:59.400
Oh.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.760
The thing is, Ayasaki isn't with them.

19:01.760 --> 19:05.880
And Kono-san was holding 
what looked like a present.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.040
You're spilling your drink! It's everywhere!

19:08.040 --> 19:09.560
Is Sengoku-san cheating on her?!

19:09.560 --> 19:11.170
We can't be sure!

19:12.170 --> 19:14.630
Does that mean Ayasaki-san is free now?

19:14.630 --> 19:15.530
This is my chance!

19:15.530 --> 19:17.770
We really can't be sure of that!

19:17.770 --> 19:19.430
And why do I have to wipe this up?

19:19.430 --> 19:20.780
You should be doing this!

19:20.780 --> 19:23.470
I figured that loud voice 
belonged to Iura-kun.

19:24.430 --> 19:26.460
I'm not thinking of anything underhanded!

19:28.180 --> 19:30.690
You're not with Ayasaki today, huh?

19:31.540 --> 19:32.690
Not today.

19:32.690 --> 19:36.030
<i>I'm not sure how to interpret that response.</i>

19:36.500 --> 19:37.940
Don't tell Remi that you saw me.

19:37.940 --> 19:40.260
What'll happen if I do tell her?

19:37.940 --> 19:42.030
<b>Suddenly
bold</b>

19:40.260 --> 19:42.030
Shu, shut up.

19:43.460 --> 19:44.910
Don't tell Remi.

19:44.910 --> 19:46.450
I'm very sorry. I will take it to my grave.

19:48.270 --> 19:49.730
What was that about?

19:50.320 --> 19:51.520
See you tomorrow.

19:51.520 --> 19:53.450
Yeah, see you tomorrow.

19:59.120 --> 20:03.750
Aw, on the next mock exam? I can't!

20:03.750 --> 20:08.350
I've never scored above a forty in math.

20:08.350 --> 20:09.660
Go for sixty.

20:09.660 --> 20:11.210
I can't.

20:12.040 --> 20:15.730
Well, if you score at least sixty,
we'll go to that chocolate shop you like...

20:15.730 --> 20:16.460
and get...

20:16.460 --> 20:18.090
Premium cookies?!

20:18.090 --> 20:19.870
Yeah, that.

20:20.490 --> 20:24.240
W-Well, I'm not motivated by material things.

20:24.730 --> 20:26.640
Anyway, good luck!

20:29.930 --> 20:31.750
Next is...

20:31.750 --> 20:33.250
Mathematics Practice Test Answer Sheet

20:32.100 --> 20:33.250
That's great.

20:33.610 --> 20:36.250
You've never gotten higher 
than forty before, right?

20:39.350 --> 20:42.440
She says she's not motivated
by material things.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.390
Huh?

20:56.080 --> 20:57.340
Good morning, Remi.

20:57.770 --> 20:59.380
Oh, Sakura!

20:59.380 --> 21:01.530
You left without me yesterday!

21:01.530 --> 21:03.250
I didn't know what to think!

21:03.250 --> 21:04.790
I'm sorry.

21:04.790 --> 21:05.780
You see, Remi...

21:05.780 --> 21:07.030
This is for you.

21:07.880 --> 21:09.040
Cookies?!

21:09.040 --> 21:10.310
B-But why?!

21:10.310 --> 21:12.580
I didn't get a sixty on the mock exam...

21:12.580 --> 21:14.040
What do you mean?

21:14.870 --> 21:18.040
I was just in the area and picked these up.

21:22.670 --> 21:25.550
Wow, you were right. These are delicious.

21:25.550 --> 21:28.050
I-I want one, too.

21:28.050 --> 21:29.210
Go ahead.

21:32.020 --> 21:34.130
I make cookies myself from time to time,

21:34.130 --> 21:36.580
but ones from a shop 
can really hit the spot.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.510
Sakura, thank you.

21:43.760 --> 21:44.940
Did you say something?

21:45.820 --> 21:47.230
Nope!

21:47.230 --> 21:48.320
Oh?

21:48.320 --> 21:51.380
Shouldn't Sengoku-kun have some, too?

21:51.380 --> 21:52.330
Here's what he said:

21:52.650 --> 21:55.610
"No. If I had any, there 
would be less for Remi."

21:57.440 --> 21:59.080
That was exactly like him, Sakura!

21:59.080 --> 22:00.220
I know, right?

22:00.220 --> 22:01.900
You're really good at impressions!

22:01.900 --> 22:03.680
That was nothing like me! Damn you, Sakura!

22:03.680 --> 22:05.340
I thought you wanted to stay hidden.

22:05.340 --> 22:07.150
Sakura!

22:07.150 --> 22:08.770
There, there, there, there...

23:36.470 --> 23:40.220
Next time
page.7 Friends
